[ system ]
Choose whom each person would write to, if anyone, using their profiles, memories and Skyrim's lore.
[ end system ]

[ user ]
{% for w in writers %}
## {{ w.number }}. {{ w.name }}, {{ w.place }}
{{ render_character_profile("short_inline", w.UUID) }}
{% if w.memories and length(w.memories) > 0 %}
Lately:
{% for memory in w.memories -%}
- {{ memory }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if w.letters and length(w.letters) > 0 %}
Letters:
{% for line in w.letters -%}
- {{ line }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
For each writer, name up to {{ names }} recipients, best first:

- A specific person, by their own name as Skyrim knows them.
- Someone who lives in another place than the writer.
- A personal connection or someone they have practical business with. Match familiarity to their established relationship.
- A fellow NPC ({{ player }} is the player character).

Return one compact JSON object on one line containing the writers who have a recipient, keyed by writer number: {"<number>":["<name>","<name>"]}. Return {} for an empty selection.
[ end user ]
